---
// FeatureShowcase.astro - Section 3: Pure White Canvas with Elevated IDE on Architectural Plinth
---

<section id="editor" class="bg-white py-24 lg:py-32 border-y border-[#D0DCD9]/40 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Editorial Specs & Narrative -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-center">
        <!-- Kicker -->
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="w-6 h-[1px] bg-[#52656B]/60"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-kicker uppercase text-[#52656B]">
            INTELLIGENT DEVELOPMENT ENVIRONMENT
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Headline (Editorial Serif) -->
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold text-[#1C2A30] tracking-tight leading-[1.15] mb-6">
          AI Code Editor &amp; <br />
          <span class="italic font-normal">Real-Time Workspace.</span>
        </h2>

        <!-- Descriptive Copy -->
        <p class="text-[#52656B] text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 font-normal">
          Designed from the ground up for instantaneous browser execution. Write, refactor, and run multi-language code with zero latency, native syntax intelligence, and client-side sandbox safety.
        </p>

        <!-- Feature Points List -->
        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 text-sm text-[#1C2A30]">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#E8F0EE] flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold">&check;</span>
            <span>Client-side syntax synthesis with zero external telemetries</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#E8F0EE] flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold">&check;</span>
            <span>Multi-language compilation (JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, HTML/CSS)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#E8F0EE] flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold">&check;</span>
            <span>Instant sandbox preview &amp; automated test harness</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Dual CTAs: Dark Obsidian Pill & Text Link -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6">
          <a 
            href="https://ladestack.in" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-white bg-[#1C2A30] hover:bg-[#2C3E46] rounded-full shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"
          >
            <span>Try Code Editor</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <a 
            href="#architecture" 
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-[#52656B] hover:text-[#1C2A30] transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Read Architecture Specs</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Elevated Device Mockup on Architectural Stone Plinth (Ref Section 2 Object) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 relative">
        <!-- Architectural Backdrop Halo -->
        <div class="absolute -inset-6 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#E3EBE9]/60 to-[#EEF4F2]/30 rounded-3xl -z-10 blur-xl"></div>
        
        <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-pedestal-lg border border-[#D0DCD9]/80 bg-[#F4F7F6] group">
          <img 
            src="/assets/ide-pedestal.jpg" 
            alt="LadeStack AI Code Editor perched on architectural stone pedestal"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-[420px] sm:h-[500px] object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
          />

          <!-- Floating Glass Specs Overlay -->
          <div class="absolute top-6 left-6 right-6 flex items-center justify-between pointer-events-none">
            <div class="glass-pill px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-medium text-[#1C2A30] shadow-sm flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
              <span>WebAssembly Sandbox v2.4</span>
            </div>
            <div class="glass-pill px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono text-[#52656B] shadow-sm hidden sm:block">
              Latency: &lt; 4ms
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Bottom Glass Card with Live Code Snippet Preview -->
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 p-4 rounded-2xl glass-panel shadow-md border border-white/80">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-400"></span>
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
                <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#52656B] ml-2">editor.worker.ts &mdash; Isolated Sandbox</span>
              </div>
              <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-100/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">0 Server Calls</span>
            </div>
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-[#1C2A30]/90 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre">
<span class="text-indigo-600 font-semibold">import</span> &#123; createEngine &#125; <span class="text-indigo-600 font-semibold">from</span> <span class="text-emerald-700">"@ladestack/wasm-core"</span>;
<span class="text-indigo-600 font-semibold">const</span> engine = <span class="text-indigo-600 font-semibold">await</span> createEngine(&#123; sandbox: <span class="text-amber-700">"pure-client"</span> &#125;);
<span class="text-indigo-600 font-semibold">await</span> engine.compileAndExecute(sourceCode); <span class="text-gray-400">// 100% In-Browser</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Architectural Plinth Shadow Accent -->
        <div class="w-3/4 mx-auto h-4 bg-[#1C2A30]/10 rounded-full blur-md mt-4"></div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
